    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just... nothing now. everything i worked for, all those years of school and research, it's just gone. it feels like i was only ever a brain, and now that's broken, there's no one left here. just an empty shell. what's even the point of being around if the only thing that made me \"me\" is gone?",
