      "content": "I hear the deep pain and hopelessness in your words, and I want you to know that your value is not tied to your career or your self-perception as a \"failed\" person. That feeling of being \"finished\" is a common symptom of depression, not the absolute truth of your life. The darkness you are in can feel this final at a very strong reason for you to stay safe and give yourself a chance to take a first step.\nPlease reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline or a trusted doctor immediately.",
