      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the finality you are feeling, but I want you to know that depression trickles the end decision to be \"logical\" and the world is able to feel \"permanent\" even when it is not. The sense that you are \"dead\" as a self is a common symptom of deep depression, not an accurate reflection of reality, and the \"end\" you feel is a feeling, not a fact. Please consider talking to a crisis counselor at 988 to help you process this feeling and find a safe place to rest.",
